function classify ( value / i32 ) / Result ( i32 ) (
  let result / i32 ( 0 ) ·
  if less ( value, 0 ) ( set result ( sub ( 0, value ) ) · ) ~ otherwise ( set result ( value ) · ) ·
  return ok ( result ) ·
) ·
function bounded_search ( limit / i32 ) / Result ( u64 ) (
  let hits / u64 ( convert_u64 ( 0 ) ) ·
  loop cursor / i32 ( from: 0, max: 8 ) (
    if equal ( cursor, limit ) ( break · ) ~ otherwise ( set hits ( wrapping_add ( hits, convert_u64 ( 1 ) ) ) · continue · ) ·
  ) ·
  return ok ( hits ) ·
) ·
function status_path ( fail / bool ) / Result ( i32 ) (
  if equal ( fail, true ) ( return err ( 12 ) · ) ~ otherwise ( return ok ( 1 ) · ) ·
) ·
